              "sourceRegion": "Question 2c",
              "description": "Unfilled horizontal rectangle with a question mark below the bottom side and two-sevenths centimetres beside the right side.",
              "mathematics": "Area is 8 cm² and the known side is 2/7 cm; the bottom length is unknown. Source illustration is schematic.",
              "answerVisibility": "Known side and question mark remain visible; missing length is withheld."
