        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\frac{27}{5}\\text{ cm}$",
          "worked": "Half the perimeter is the sum of two adjacent sides.\n$$\\begin{align*}\\text{Missing length}&=12\\div2-\\frac{3}{5}\\\\&=6-\\frac{3}{5}\\\\&=\\frac{30}{5}-\\frac{3}{5}\\\\&=\\frac{27}{5}\\text{ cm}\\end{align*}$$",
